<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hertz Corp rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hertz Corp rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst David Bradley initiated coverage of Hertz Corp with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $35 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings per share estimates of $1.68 for 1997 and $2.02 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan was the lead underwriter of Hertz's recent initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 to 29-3/4.</p>
</text>
